WEBVTT

00:01.110 --> 00:03.320
It's been two weeks since
Makoto became a lecturer.

00:03.320 --> 00:05.240
A new store outside Tsige is now open.

00:05.650 --> 00:07.950
KUZUNOHA
The Kuzunoha Company of Rotsgard

00:07.950 --> 00:10.700
KUZUNOHA
is now open for business.

00:12.350 --> 00:13.160
A personnel change.

00:13.870 --> 00:14.700
Are you kidding me?

00:14.700 --> 00:17.000
Young Master, this is unreasonable!

00:17.310 --> 00:18.870
We are terribly sorry.

00:18.870 --> 00:21.830
The others have their hands full
at the Tsige store.

00:22.130 --> 00:23.630
Please! I beg of you!

00:23.630 --> 00:24.920
If you suddenly fire us,

00:24.920 --> 00:27.590
who knows what Lady Tomoe
and Lady Mio will do to us?

00:27.590 --> 00:29.050
Uwu.

00:30.260 --> 00:31.550
Fine.

00:32.970 --> 00:34.430
This is for external injury.

00:34.850 --> 00:37.890
This counters poisoning.
Those are fever medicine and painkillers.

00:37.890 --> 00:39.640
That is an energy drink.

00:39.640 --> 00:40.520
Write it down.

00:40.520 --> 00:41.770
Why can't you do it?

00:42.280 --> 00:45.370
This pharmacy and grocery store
is going to be open until late at night.

00:45.370 --> 00:47.070
That should slowly build our reputation.

00:47.740 --> 00:50.610
We are open until midnight.

00:51.410 --> 00:52.740
This is a sweatshop.

00:52.740 --> 00:53.320
Shush.

00:53.700 --> 00:57.450
You work in shifts and get to take breaks.

00:57.450 --> 00:59.080
There is also a food allowance.

00:59.790 --> 01:00.920
Breaks...

01:00.920 --> 01:02.040
Food...

01:02.040 --> 01:04.340
You don't have
a nagging manager around.

01:04.340 --> 01:06.710
Given it's a new store,
I doubt it'll get too busy.

01:07.090 --> 01:10.550
In other words, it's much easier here
than the Tsige store.

01:11.090 --> 01:12.260
A lot easier...

01:12.260 --> 01:13.760
Than Tsige...

01:14.050 --> 01:16.010
Awesome!

01:16.850 --> 01:19.850
I'm already feeling
a bit concerned on the first day.

01:19.850 --> 01:21.480
What should I do?

01:41.500 --> 01:47.550
TSUKIMICHI -MOONLIT FANTASY- SEASON 2

02:52.030 --> 02:53.170
NIGHT 6: BECOMING A THREE-STAR CHEF

02:53.170 --> 02:55.610
NIGHT 6: BECOMING A THREE-STAR CHEF
My business and classes are going well.

02:56.280 --> 02:58.070
Or so I thought...

02:58.620 --> 03:02.290
Mr. Kuzunoha, please marry me!

03:02.610 --> 03:05.000
Make me your third wife.

03:05.420 --> 03:10.210
I never thought polygamy
was common in this world.

03:10.210 --> 03:12.630
- They want to overlook my face...
- Please marry me!

03:12.630 --> 03:17.200
- and be a third wife free from any duty.
- Please marry me!

03:18.140 --> 03:20.260
Is this even a marriage?

03:20.810 --> 03:24.060
From what I know, a marriage means
the husband and wife should...

03:24.060 --> 03:26.300
Excuse me, who are those two?

03:27.480 --> 03:31.320
They are the kind people
who had taken great care of me.

03:31.980 --> 03:34.530
They were very close.

03:34.530 --> 03:36.700
Knowing them makes me
think the students here

03:36.700 --> 03:38.910
have a weird concept about marriage.

03:39.180 --> 03:43.700
Many students here are children
of famous aristocrats and merchants.

03:43.700 --> 03:47.870
Some people simply don't see
how love can develop into a marriage.

03:47.870 --> 03:50.830
Like a marriage of convenience?

03:51.250 --> 03:53.710
Aren't they too young
to even have these ideas?

03:54.510 --> 03:56.920
Mr. Kuzunoha, how childish of you.

03:56.920 --> 03:58.950
Nope, you're utterly ignorant.

04:00.620 --> 04:02.770
I suddenly feel like those two
are leagues better

04:02.770 --> 04:04.970
since they didn't
befriend me for my money.

04:06.850 --> 04:07.940
So,

04:08.250 --> 04:10.940
are there any findings
after investigating the great forest?

04:10.940 --> 04:11.730
Yes.

04:12.150 --> 04:14.480
Before the great battle at Stellar Fort,

04:14.480 --> 04:17.070
someone was engaged in combat
with Waterfall Lyca.

04:18.200 --> 04:21.990
It was probably a dragon slayer
known as Sophia Bulga.

04:23.870 --> 04:25.240
What about you, Boss?

04:25.240 --> 04:27.810
Have you found any leads
about the ring

04:27.810 --> 04:29.330
that seals the goddess' power away?

04:29.330 --> 04:32.290
No. I couldn't find anything.

04:32.290 --> 04:35.840
But I found out who created
the Star Lake.

04:35.840 --> 04:37.840
The answer is pretty obvious.

04:38.260 --> 04:39.880
The Young Master is the only one...

04:39.880 --> 04:42.680
I think you've been tailed.

04:46.020 --> 04:47.290
Who is it?

04:47.810 --> 04:50.060
We are a group of humble travelers.

04:50.060 --> 04:52.940
I was told I could procure
rare and fine weapons here.

04:52.940 --> 04:54.800
It's the reason we came here.

04:56.110 --> 04:58.190
Are they after this as well?

04:59.030 --> 05:00.110
Come in.

05:01.320 --> 05:02.570
Excuse me.

05:06.040 --> 05:08.470
A samurai? Or is this cosplay?

05:10.160 --> 05:11.790
I am Tomoe.

05:11.790 --> 05:13.290
This man is Raim.

05:13.290 --> 05:16.960
We work as guards for
the Kuzunoha Company at the border.

05:16.960 --> 05:18.260
I see.

05:18.550 --> 05:20.930
Now I know why you have
such a fine inventory.

05:20.930 --> 05:24.430
The way you speak
is very old-fashioned.

05:24.430 --> 05:25.930
I bet you are very strong.

05:26.260 --> 05:27.350
How old are you?

05:27.970 --> 05:30.230
I failed to catch your meaning.

05:31.020 --> 05:34.730
Asking a woman about her age
before even introducing yourself?

05:35.020 --> 05:36.460
Where are your manners?

05:37.610 --> 05:41.570
This is Master Tomoki Iwahashi.
The girl is his servant, Mora.

05:42.070 --> 05:43.950
I am Lily.

05:44.220 --> 05:46.760
The Second Princess of Gritonia?

05:47.190 --> 05:49.500
The guy next to her
must be the hero.

05:50.200 --> 05:53.290
You look like knights or aristocrats
from another kingdom.

05:53.290 --> 05:55.290
What brings you here?

05:55.290 --> 05:57.960
We are here to check on the lake...

05:57.960 --> 05:58.920
- that appeared out of nowhere.
- Hey.

05:58.920 --> 06:00.760
That's a katana you're carrying.

06:00.760 --> 06:01.670
Let me have a look.

06:01.670 --> 06:03.380
Sure.

06:03.380 --> 06:04.930
What makes this katana special...

06:04.930 --> 06:05.640
Sorry.

06:05.640 --> 06:07.140
I'm not interested in its story.

06:09.220 --> 06:10.600
I can't draw it.

06:10.600 --> 06:11.140
Darn it.

06:11.140 --> 06:12.450
Sorry.

06:12.890 --> 06:16.150
A spell was cast on it.
Only I can draw that blade.

06:16.150 --> 06:18.190
Impossible!

06:18.190 --> 06:20.860
I have the power to command
any weapons in this world!

06:21.560 --> 06:23.700
This weapon is my partner.

06:24.490 --> 06:26.320
Please be gentle with it.

06:26.320 --> 06:29.080
If you want to see the edge so badly,
this should be enough.

06:29.950 --> 06:31.290
The name is Shirafuji.

06:31.830 --> 06:33.430
Take a good look.

06:33.960 --> 06:35.250
Incredible...

06:35.510 --> 06:36.420
This is...

06:36.420 --> 06:37.710
Beautiful...

06:37.710 --> 06:39.300
Are you satisfied now?

06:39.300 --> 06:41.040
My friend and I are busy.

06:41.510 --> 06:43.440
You may leave now.

06:43.920 --> 06:44.880
About that weapon...

06:45.590 --> 06:47.910
We'd like to purchase it
if you'd name a price.

06:48.350 --> 06:50.220
Will you sell it to us?

06:50.930 --> 06:53.930
Did you not hear me?
Only I can wield it.

06:54.850 --> 06:58.400
I didn't want to announce myself,
but you've left me with no choice.

06:58.650 --> 07:02.010
I am Princess Lily of the Gritonia Empire.

07:02.610 --> 07:07.160
Master Tomoki is a hero sent
to our nation by the goddess herself.

07:07.690 --> 07:08.990
For the sake of the humans...

07:08.990 --> 07:11.950
No, for the future of this world,

07:11.950 --> 07:13.620
will you lend us your strength?

07:14.500 --> 07:15.830
That sounds intimidating.

07:16.290 --> 07:18.170
From what I see,

07:18.170 --> 07:21.500
you need the katana
for a different agenda.

07:21.960 --> 07:23.040
Perhaps you need it...

07:23.460 --> 07:26.220
as a reference to develop
your own arsenals.

07:26.760 --> 07:28.230
Please, you're overreacting.

07:28.720 --> 07:31.290
I'm never selling it,
no matter how much you pay.

07:31.760 --> 07:33.640
That's the end of our conversation.

07:38.230 --> 07:41.520
Boss, the hero party needs our assistance.

07:41.520 --> 07:44.190
Our company has nothing to lose
by helping them.

07:44.490 --> 07:47.530
I think the hero
can wield mine just fine.

07:47.530 --> 07:48.200
He can have...

07:48.450 --> 07:49.870
Silence.

07:49.870 --> 07:51.280
Boss?

07:51.280 --> 07:53.870
Sorry. My subordinate
has been acting strange today.

07:55.000 --> 07:56.660
Forget about the katana.

07:56.660 --> 07:57.580
Big Brother?

07:57.960 --> 07:59.420
I am the hero.

08:00.080 --> 08:04.340
My goal is to vanquish all demons
and bring peace to the world.

08:04.880 --> 08:06.300
Lady Tomoe,

08:07.470 --> 08:09.580
I need your help to realize that goal.

08:09.990 --> 08:12.220
Devote yourself to my cause.

08:14.140 --> 08:15.350
I see.

08:16.850 --> 08:20.470
But first, can you please stop
giving me the disgusting stare?

08:21.230 --> 08:23.360
Dis... Disgusting?

08:23.720 --> 08:26.690
I was told the heroes
were summoned from another world.

08:27.280 --> 08:29.390
But this man is such a let-down.

08:29.820 --> 08:33.830
Not to mention, he kept staring
at my body in a disgusting manner.

08:33.830 --> 08:34.200
BEHOLD!

08:34.200 --> 08:37.789
Thought I'd love
for the Young Master to try that.

08:39.210 --> 08:43.000
You haven't let us know
if you're accepting my invitation or not.

08:43.340 --> 08:45.130
The answer is a firm no.

08:45.630 --> 08:49.380
I'm already devoting my heart
and soul to my master.

08:50.050 --> 08:52.190
I couldn't charm her
with my Devil Eye?

08:52.820 --> 08:55.010
Tomoe, aren't you a dragon?

08:56.010 --> 08:57.020
Oh...

08:57.350 --> 08:59.170
And not just any ordinary dragon.

08:59.560 --> 09:03.480
You're a powerful dragon
with pure aura and strength.

09:04.190 --> 09:06.610
Speaking of the strongest
dragon in this area...

09:06.610 --> 09:07.940
Could she be Waterfall Lyca?

09:09.530 --> 09:11.300
I am not Lyca.

09:12.320 --> 09:14.370
She... She read my mind.

09:14.700 --> 09:15.410
Tomoe,

09:15.660 --> 09:18.410
join me and assist
my Big Brother in his cause!

09:19.540 --> 09:23.130
Huh? The ability to command dragons.

09:24.000 --> 09:27.090
Are you what they call
a dragon summoner?

09:29.970 --> 09:31.580
Tomoe...

09:32.220 --> 09:33.340
I...

09:33.890 --> 09:36.760
Cast your foolish thoughts away,
little girl!

09:40.730 --> 09:43.270
Why was I handing him my katana?

09:43.730 --> 09:45.900
She negated the effect of my Devil Eye...

09:46.440 --> 09:49.400
Why would I hand
my katana to someone like him?

09:50.070 --> 09:52.950
Watch your mouth,

09:53.410 --> 09:54.910
you piece of trash!

09:58.490 --> 09:59.950
Oh my.

09:59.950 --> 10:02.410
You're acting like a kid
who's throwing a tantrum.

10:02.410 --> 10:05.710
Shut up! I'm the hero here!

10:05.710 --> 10:07.420
Hero from the Gritonia Empire,

10:07.800 --> 10:10.880
you are a hopeless scoundrel.

10:15.720 --> 10:18.570
Don't look at me like that!

10:20.180 --> 10:21.730
Princess Lily,

10:21.730 --> 10:24.350
let's pretend
this meeting never took place.

10:25.350 --> 10:30.650
If you can't read between the lines
and brew some silly plans,

10:30.650 --> 10:34.860
the hero from the Empire will soon perish.
Remember my warning.

10:35.490 --> 10:39.320
A dragon who can use mist and illusion,
not to mention read my thoughts.

10:40.290 --> 10:44.500
Tomoe is the rare character
of the highest level imaginable.

10:44.730 --> 10:45.960
I want her.

10:45.960 --> 10:48.030
I must make her mine!

10:50.670 --> 10:52.550
How did that happen?

10:52.550 --> 10:56.090
I was handing over the precious katana
you and the Young Master gave me

10:56.930 --> 10:59.130
to that pretentious brat!

11:00.350 --> 11:01.720
Raim.

11:01.720 --> 11:03.980
Will you become my servant?

11:03.980 --> 11:04.690
Yes.

11:05.300 --> 11:07.060
Not even a bit of hesitation?

11:07.610 --> 11:11.190
I'm happy to become stronger
at my own pace,

11:12.400 --> 11:14.820
but I lack strength
when time calls for it.

11:14.820 --> 11:17.530
I don't want that to become my regret.

11:18.320 --> 11:20.030
Well then, let's begin.

11:21.370 --> 11:23.370
Don't worry.
This won't hurt.

11:23.370 --> 11:24.750
It will be over in a moment.

11:27.540 --> 11:29.000
So, this is seaweed.

11:29.540 --> 11:32.210
I can't tell what species this is.

11:34.630 --> 11:36.380
Delicious.

11:36.380 --> 11:38.450
The dried part tastes savory.

11:38.450 --> 11:40.670
It's not too hard,
so even a human can chew it.

11:40.670 --> 11:41.890
And seaweed isn't poisonous.

11:42.220 --> 11:43.850
Hold on! Stop!

11:44.640 --> 11:46.810
Oh my, what a nuisance.

11:54.230 --> 11:57.490
You drenched my kimono.

12:00.490 --> 12:02.580
Die, cursed mutt.

12:09.210 --> 12:10.750
Are you the owner?

12:11.210 --> 12:13.050
Very well.
You will both die.

12:13.340 --> 12:15.710
Are you all right?
Did you get hurt?

12:16.920 --> 12:19.010
It lunged at you.

12:19.010 --> 12:20.550
I can understand
if you're angry.

12:20.550 --> 12:21.930
I'm so terribly sorry!

12:22.600 --> 12:24.430
A human who puts a stranger's life

12:24.430 --> 12:26.290
before her own?

12:26.290 --> 12:28.100
And the black hair...

12:28.100 --> 12:29.690
I will take full responsibility

12:29.940 --> 12:31.850
and make sure it reflects on the mistake.

12:33.170 --> 12:34.190
Reflect on the mistake?

12:34.190 --> 12:34.980
Cut it out, Howl!

12:34.980 --> 12:36.450
Get back here!

12:38.950 --> 12:41.200
Oh, is that a spirit of some sort?

12:41.200 --> 12:44.030
It's like a guardian beast.

12:44.580 --> 12:47.200
AWKWARD SMILE
I'm not very sure either.

12:47.200 --> 12:50.790
Somehow she reminds me
of the Young Master.

12:50.790 --> 12:51.710
AWKWARD SMILE

12:52.080 --> 12:53.630
My name is Hibiki.

12:53.630 --> 12:56.630
Allow me to treat your injury
and fix the kimono for you.

12:56.630 --> 12:57.840
I'm Mio.

12:57.840 --> 12:59.300
I wasn't injured.

12:59.800 --> 13:02.430
There are only some minor
marks on my kimono.

13:02.430 --> 13:04.510
Let me make it up to you.

13:04.510 --> 13:06.640
Well, in that case...

13:07.470 --> 13:11.020
Can you help me pick
the good seaweed out from the bunch?

13:11.020 --> 13:13.480
You mean konbu and wakame?

13:13.770 --> 13:14.940
Wakame?

13:14.940 --> 13:16.230
Are you a wakame?

13:16.230 --> 13:17.610
No, I'm Hibiki!

13:17.610 --> 13:18.940
You just told me that.

13:18.940 --> 13:21.740
Can you tell konbu and wakame apart?

13:21.740 --> 13:23.910
Well...

13:24.140 --> 13:24.870
This is konbu,

13:24.870 --> 13:26.120
KONBU
This is konbu,

13:26.120 --> 13:28.370
WAKAME
and that is wakame.

13:28.370 --> 13:30.050
This is wakame?

13:30.050 --> 13:31.920
I thought the green
would be more vibrant.

13:31.920 --> 13:34.540
It will have a pretty
green shine after you cook it.

13:35.090 --> 13:37.040
It makes a miso soup...
No...

13:37.040 --> 13:38.550
It can make your soup taste better.

13:38.870 --> 13:41.010
- Miso soup!
- The stench!

13:41.260 --> 13:43.890
You must know how to cook.

13:43.890 --> 13:44.760
Wonderful!

13:44.760 --> 13:47.180
I met you, thanks to the Young Master!

13:47.180 --> 13:49.890
Who is that? Ouch!

13:49.890 --> 13:51.480
Ouch! Your hold is too strong!

13:51.480 --> 13:53.100
THE HERO OF LIMIA AND THE BLACK SPIDER
Ms. Mio, let me go!

13:53.100 --> 13:54.440
OF CALAMITY MEET AGAIN.
Ms. Mio, let me go!

13:56.190 --> 13:58.360
Hibiki, are you and your party

13:58.360 --> 14:00.780
TWO DAYS LATER
going to Tsige to get better weapons?

14:01.030 --> 14:03.530
Yeah. We ran into some setbacks.

14:03.860 --> 14:06.450
But that's of little importance now.

14:06.450 --> 14:10.540
Now, about the dish
that requires cover...

14:10.540 --> 14:13.790
I think you mean the pot lid.

14:13.790 --> 14:15.290
It's a cooking method.

14:15.790 --> 14:16.720
Hibiki...

14:17.210 --> 14:18.950
She looks perfectly normal,

14:18.950 --> 14:21.170
but the trauma has left
a bigger scar than expected.

14:21.920 --> 14:24.130
We are only traveling
with our identity hidden

14:24.130 --> 14:26.430
to help her cope with the grief.

14:29.560 --> 14:31.430
Tell me one thing.

14:32.060 --> 14:34.730
Are you guys very strong?

14:36.360 --> 14:39.610
I think we can hold our own in combat.

14:39.610 --> 14:40.400
Is that so?

14:40.750 --> 14:43.830
Can I trust you to take care
of the rare creature...

14:44.320 --> 14:46.160
coming this way?

14:46.820 --> 14:49.410
I can deal with it myself if you can't.

14:49.410 --> 14:50.870
What is that?

14:51.450 --> 14:53.210
The wind is strong.

14:57.880 --> 14:59.670
Chiya, deploy the shields.

14:59.670 --> 15:01.260
Mr. Woody, cast the support spells.

15:01.630 --> 15:02.510
- Yes!
- Understood!

15:03.840 --> 15:04.970
Leave it to me!

15:06.430 --> 15:08.570
Oh my, pretty impressive.

15:08.570 --> 15:09.260
However,

15:09.890 --> 15:11.700
the equipment is too weak.

15:13.350 --> 15:15.560
We didn't expect to run
into a powerful foe

15:15.560 --> 15:17.690
before we could resupply in Tsige.

15:18.360 --> 15:21.150
I have to assist her like Naval used to.

15:21.150 --> 15:23.570
For Hibiki's sake...

15:23.780 --> 15:24.900
Fool! Dodge!

15:32.200 --> 15:33.240
Verda!

15:35.580 --> 15:36.810
We must regroup.

15:36.810 --> 15:37.960
Hibiki, what's the order?

15:41.670 --> 15:42.470
No...

15:46.470 --> 15:48.470
Ms. Mio, we need your help.

15:51.140 --> 15:52.350
Unbelievable.

15:52.350 --> 15:55.140
You don't even know your own limits.

15:55.140 --> 15:56.520
How disappointing.

16:03.610 --> 16:04.440
Die.

16:06.740 --> 16:07.490
What...

16:07.490 --> 16:08.610
The job is done.

16:10.780 --> 16:11.660
Huh?

16:12.530 --> 16:14.370
Is the one on the ground all right?

16:14.370 --> 16:17.210
Yes. No fatal injuries.

16:17.620 --> 16:19.410
In that case, there's no need for my help.

16:19.870 --> 16:22.170
I need to collect the materials,
so please dissect...

16:22.170 --> 16:23.540
Ms. Mio, behind you!

16:28.090 --> 16:29.220
It looks great on you.

16:33.180 --> 16:37.850
How dare you ruin
the kimono he praised?

16:39.100 --> 16:42.270
Die, cursed bug!

16:51.070 --> 16:53.780
Is there a way to fix the kimono?

16:56.450 --> 17:00.120
Now is not the time
to take a leisurely stroll.

17:00.120 --> 17:01.670
We should press on.

17:12.550 --> 17:13.930
I see.

17:13.930 --> 17:17.470
It's seen me before.

17:17.470 --> 17:20.020
That must be why it lunged at me.

17:20.640 --> 17:23.270
But I am different now.

17:23.650 --> 17:26.980
I did save your master just now.

17:27.440 --> 17:29.320
Rest assured, I won't harm them.

17:29.320 --> 17:32.200
So, don't tell them my true identity,

17:32.200 --> 17:32.990
little mutt.

17:34.620 --> 17:36.450
Oh my, aren't you a smart one?

17:48.840 --> 17:50.890
I brought you to Tsige.

17:51.280 --> 17:53.640
Head for the Kuzunoha Company
after you get out of bed.

17:54.640 --> 17:56.360
The Kuzunoha Company?

17:59.310 --> 18:01.770
Oh, you're finally here.

18:02.100 --> 18:03.900
Thank you for saving us.

18:03.900 --> 18:06.940
How was your kimono?

18:06.940 --> 18:08.400
I will get it fixed.

18:08.820 --> 18:10.150
I feel like this kimono

18:10.150 --> 18:13.320
will be a bit overwhelming
for the Young Master.

18:14.450 --> 18:18.040
Do you want to talk about the attack?

18:18.950 --> 18:22.410
I asked for your help in the end.

18:22.790 --> 18:25.380
It's only natural
that you're mad at me.

18:25.380 --> 18:27.630
Why would I be?

18:27.860 --> 18:30.920
You're alive.
Isn't that a good thing?

18:30.920 --> 18:33.050
So, why did you ask me
to come here?

18:33.880 --> 18:35.050
To make food, of course.

18:36.050 --> 18:37.970
As a way of repaying me,

18:37.970 --> 18:40.100
stay here for a little while.

18:40.100 --> 18:43.690
You haven't told me how to
make a soup with seaweed.

18:43.950 --> 18:46.690
You want to make a soup?
Is that all?

18:46.690 --> 18:47.900
Yes, that's all.

18:47.900 --> 18:49.570
Lady Mio.

18:49.570 --> 18:52.940
We traveled to Tsige
to acquire new weapons

18:52.940 --> 18:54.780
and hone our skills in the wild.

18:54.780 --> 18:56.110
We are in a hurry.

18:56.570 --> 19:00.910
It's an utter waste of time for a party
that can't even handle

19:00.910 --> 19:02.450
a beast of that level.

19:02.830 --> 19:05.000
You'll become the beasts' snack.

19:05.000 --> 19:06.960
No way...

19:07.210 --> 19:11.300
That won't waver our resolve
to become stronger.

19:12.300 --> 19:15.090
I don't know your reason
for being so determined.

19:15.090 --> 19:16.340
What should I do now?

19:16.680 --> 19:19.720
I have a proposition.

19:19.720 --> 19:24.020
I'll craft some equipment
suitable for combat in the wild.

19:24.020 --> 19:25.810
You can pay me later.

19:26.230 --> 19:28.450
During the three days
while I craft your equipment

19:28.450 --> 19:30.330
and until the night
when the training ends,

19:30.330 --> 19:34.320
please teach Lady Mio
how to become a proper cook.

19:34.630 --> 19:36.950
Velen! There's no guarantee
their new equipment

19:36.950 --> 19:38.740
can keep them from dying.

19:38.740 --> 19:40.280
TOUCHED
Ms. Mio...

19:40.780 --> 19:44.910
What makes you think I can master
the soup recipe in just three days?

19:45.960 --> 19:47.370
That's her true concern!

19:48.670 --> 19:49.840
If you're concerned,

19:49.840 --> 19:53.590
let Toa's party go to the wild with them.
How does that sound?

19:53.820 --> 19:55.090
I get it now.

19:55.090 --> 19:57.880
With them around,
the chance of survival is higher.

19:57.880 --> 19:59.590
Excellent idea, Velen.

19:59.590 --> 20:01.050
I'm flattered.

20:01.850 --> 20:03.010
Now,

20:03.010 --> 20:05.730
what do you think?

20:06.980 --> 20:09.600
You... You have our thanks.

20:14.780 --> 20:17.110
You got better at picking
the right ingredients.

20:18.240 --> 20:20.570
Your cutting skills have improved.

20:20.990 --> 20:23.030
But your control of strength...

20:23.660 --> 20:24.410
I'm cracking it!

20:25.370 --> 20:26.830
Why?

20:26.830 --> 20:31.080
At least you got it done
once out of three tries.

20:31.790 --> 20:34.300
Are you using these for a dessert?

20:34.670 --> 20:36.130
Let me try one.

20:36.130 --> 20:38.340
It's spicy, but also very tasty.

20:42.600 --> 20:45.100
The broth is more important.

20:45.100 --> 20:48.060
It does taste better
when I don't overcook it.

20:49.350 --> 20:51.020
I have learned something

20:51.020 --> 20:52.440
about your palate, Ms. Mio.

20:53.110 --> 20:54.320
My conclusion is that...

20:54.940 --> 20:57.990
you have an extraordinarily
high tolerance for awful food,

20:57.990 --> 21:00.070
IT'S THE PALATE OF HEAVEN IN A SENSE
but you have a sharp sense for good food.

21:00.070 --> 21:03.030
IT'S THE PALATE OF HEAVEN IN A SENSE
In other words, I am talented.

21:03.030 --> 21:06.070
There's hope to improve if you can
tell the good flavors from the bad.

21:06.070 --> 21:07.450
What is considered tasty?

21:07.450 --> 21:09.040
What is considered gross?

21:09.040 --> 21:12.130
THERE IS HOPE FOR MIO'S COOKING SKILL.
Start by working on that!

21:12.130 --> 21:13.000
Yes!

21:14.040 --> 21:16.630
A meeting the master is unaware of.

21:17.460 --> 21:19.730
The servant and the hero
become kindred spirits.

21:20.840 --> 21:23.350
Now, back to Rotsgard.

21:25.680 --> 21:26.720
Tomoe?

21:26.720 --> 21:27.430
Yes.

21:28.230 --> 21:30.770
She seems to have a lot of
reports to make.

21:30.770 --> 21:32.940
She wants us back at the Subspace.

21:33.350 --> 21:37.900
Speaking of that, I've only spoken to her
via telepathy and haven't returned in a while.

21:38.570 --> 21:43.530
The Forest Ogre sisters
are in charge of the Rotsgard store now.

21:43.850 --> 21:45.370
I'm a bit concerned,

21:45.370 --> 21:47.370
but since the manager trusts them...

21:48.250 --> 21:49.500
I should trust them too.

21:59.340 --> 22:02.630
What is... going on?

23:35.940 --> 23:39.730
NEXT: THE AUDITION
Night 7: "The Audition."
